  "body": "The [Trust Token API](https://github.com/WICG/trust-token-api/) allows specifying certain cryptographic operations to execute alongside outgoing requests. Currently, it exposes this functionality by adding new arguments to `fetch` (`RequestInit`), `XMLHttpRequest`, and the HTML `iframe`  element. We hope in due time to extend the Fetch standard with the common Trust Tokens-related request handling logic these interface additions expose. At @annevk's suggestion, I'm creating this issue to track this work.",
